Z||000000||V8Fiero||04-01-2001||01:14 AM||||Heres a cheap taillight mod. I got the idea from my Big Fiero parts book.<P>Heres what you need:<P>6 Red bullet lenses (Signal Stat #9004)<BR>Got em from the local true value.<P>Black paint, flat or glossy. I used flat<P>Glue. I used GE silicone adhesive glue. Dries clear and is waterproof.<P>I think the install is pretty self explanitory. If anyone needs more info, feel free to ask........<P>Scott<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mar31$01.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mar31$02.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mar31$03.jpg"> <BR>||||reg||14
Z||000001||TheFiero64||04-01-2001||08:08 AM||||looks neat. I also did my own mod for $10 bucks. I got some stickers, stuck them in the back of the tail lights, painted them black, removed the stickers, & got this.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/May19^101.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg"> <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||10
